  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAL 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: “Rora, nintome omotomwa one andoiserie enchera, n’Omonene oyio mokorigia nache mobosokano ase Hekalu yaye; nere omotomwa bw’okobwatana kw’ogotianania oyio moganetie. Ee, ngocha are.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ning’o oranyare gotenena koremereria rituko ri’Omonene, na ning’o oranyare gotenena ase ogwekengera ekero akooroka? Ere nigo anga buna omorero bw’omoturi ebioma, na buna esabuni y’omosibia chianga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere naikaranse buna oyo ogosamba na gosibia chifeta. Ere nachene Abalawi, abasibie buna chitaabu ne chifeta chigosibigwa, erinde banyare korua ebing’wanso bi’oboronge ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ebing’wanso bi’Abayuda, na ebi’ abanto ba Yerusalemu, bigokie Omonene, buna ase amatuko aria a kare, na ase emiaka ya kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: “Nimbaike ang’e ase okonacha ekiina. Nimbe kirori omwango igoro y’abarogi na abatomani, na abagotiana oborimo, na abagokorera abarikwa emeremo bobe ase okobarina ching’eria chiabo, na abagokorera ababoraka ne chintakana bobe, na abakoonchorana oboronge bw’abamenyi, korende tibanyirogeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogoakana ensemo ya ikomi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inche Omonene tindi koonchoka, na ase engencho eyio, inwe ab’ororeria rwa Yakobo timwasiretigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase amatuko e chisokoro chiaino inwe mwagoberete mogatiga emeroberio y’ane echiikire, timwayebwatete. Bono inche Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo ngoteeba iga: Ing’iranera, nainche nimbairanere. Korende inwe nigo mokoboria: Tokoiranere ase inchera ki?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Omonto nanyare konyibera inche Nyasae ebiane? Korende inwe mwanyibeire ebiane. Inwe nigo mokoboria: Ninki twakoibeire? Mwanyibeire ensemo ya ikomi na okoruegwa konde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaragererigwe nokoragererigwa, ekiagera inwe egesaku eke gionsi mwanyibeire ebiane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe renta ensemo ya ikomi eng’ikeranu ase ekungo y’enyomba y’ane, erinde endagera ebe ase enyomba y’ane. Ase enchera eyio inwe monteeme gose tinkobaigorera ebibao bia igoro mbaumorere ogosesenigwa okonge mono gotari korengeka. Nabo inche Omonene bw’Emeganda ngoteeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintogonyere ebigosaria okwama kwe riroba riaino, tibigosaria, gose amasabibu aino takoaroroka kaare amarere. Nabo inche Omonene bw’Emeganda ngoteeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto b’ebisaku bionsi inabaabaroke abasesenirie, ekiagera ense yaino n’ebe y’okogokia. Nabo inche Omonene bw’Emeganda ngoteeba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eira ya Nyasae y’amaabera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: “Inwe mwakwanire amang’ana amakong’u igoro y’ane. Korende nigo mokoboria: Mang’ana ki amakong’u twakwanire igoro yao?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mwateebire: Okomokorera Nyasae, ayio namang’ana abosa. Mbuya ki twanyorire ase okobwata amachiiko aye, gose ase ogotaara ase obosio bw’Omonene bw’Emeganda tore nomoichano?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono nigo tokoroka abwo bare abaenenu ng’a mbasesenirie. Abakori amabe nabwo bagendererete konyora amaya; tari ayio oka, korende nonya nekero bagoteema Nyasae nigo bagokonywa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto abwo bamoirogete Omonene bakaba bagokwana barabwo ase barabwo; Omonene agategerera, akaigwa amang’ana abo, na egetabu y’ekeinyorio ekarikwa ase obosio bwaye ase okoinyora abwo bamoirogete na barengereretie igoro y’erieta riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: “Abanto aba mbabe abanto bane bori ase rituko erio ndakore ring’ana, nimbarorere amaabera buna omonto akorora amaabera ase omwana oye okomokorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio imorore ogwatananeka ase egati y’omonyaboronge na omokori amabe, na ase egati y’oyogonkorera inche Nyasae na oria otari gonkorera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
